  "_doc": {
    "purpose": "Journal-abbreviation -> Crossref full-title dictionary for paper-ref-hunter. Lookup at query-construction time: normalize user input to lowercase, match keys by longest-prefix, pass the value into Crossref query.container-title. Benchmark: using the full title gets 10/10 top-3 in Crossref bibliographic search; using raw abbreviations only gets 5/10. This file closes that gap.",
    "lookup_rule": "Case-insensitive longest-prefix match. 'angew chem int ed' must win over 'angew chem' which must win over 'chem'.",
    "source_of_truth": "Crossref container-title field as registered by the publisher. Do not invent alternates; add new entries only after verifying via api.crossref.org that a real record uses that exact title string.",
    "edit_rule": "Add entries freely. Remove only if a value is confirmed wrong (Crossref actually uses a different string). Multiple keys can map to one value (e.g. 'jacs' and 'j am chem soc' both -> 'Journal of the American Chemical Society')."
  },

